<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Tom_Gehrels> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Anton M.J. \"Tom\" Gehrels (February 21, 1925 – July 11, 2011) was a Dutch–American astronomer, Professor of Planetary Sciences, and Astronomer at the University of Arizona, Tucson."@en .
