<http://dbpedia.org/resource/HD_37124_c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HD 37124 c is an extrasolar planet approximately 103 light-years away in the constellation of Taurus. The planet was discovered in 2002 orbiting the star HD 37124. The planet is most likely to be a gas giant (based on its mass)."@en .
