<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_7077> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NGC 7077 is a lenticular blue compact dwarf galaxy located about 56 million light-years away from Earth in the constellation Aquarius. Discovered by astronomer Albert Marth on August 11, 1863, the galaxy lies within the Local Void."@en .
