<http://dbpedia.org/resource/CoRoT-8b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**CoRoT-8b** is a transiting [exoplanet](:Extrasolar_planet) orbiting the [K-type main sequence star](:K-type_main_sequence_star) [CoRoT-8](:CoRoT-8) 1,050 [light years](:Light_years) away in the equatorial [constellation](:Constellation) [Aquila](:Aquila_%28constellation%29). The planet was discovered in April 2010 by the CoRoT telescope."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
