<http://dbpedia.org/resource/425_Cornelia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Cornelia (minor planet designation: 425 Cornelia) is a large Main belt asteroid. It was discovered by Auguste Charlois on 28 December 1896 in Nice. It is named after Cornelia Africana."@en .
