<http://dbpedia.org/resource/CoRoT-22b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**CoRoT-22b** is a transiting [exoplanet](:Extrasolar_planet) found by the [CoRoT](:CoRoT) [space telescope](:Space_telescope) in 2011 and confirmed in 2014.It is a hot and small (smaller than [Uranus](:Uranus%29) gas giant planet orbiting a G0IV star with Te = 5939K, M = 1.099[M☉](:Solar_mass), R = 1.136[R☉](:Solar_radius), and above-solar metallicity. It has an estimated age of between 1.3 and 5.3 Gyr."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
