<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Marc_Buie> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Marc William Buie** (; born 1958) is an American [astronomer](:Astronomer) and prolific [discoverer of minor planets](:Discoverer_of_minor_planets) who works at the [Southwest Research Institute](:Southwest_Research_Institute) in Boulder, Colorado in the Space Science Department. Formerly he worked at the [Lowell Observatory](:Lowell_Observatory) in Flagstaff, Arizona, and was the [Sentinel Space Telescope](:Sentinel_%28space_telescope%29) Mission Scientist for the [B612 Foundation](:B612_Foundation), which is dedicated to protecting Earth from asteroid [impact events](:Impact_events)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
