<http://dbpedia.org/resource/WISE_1828+2650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**WISE 1828+2650** (full designation **WISEPA J182831.08+265037.8**) is a possibly binary [brown dwarf](:Brown_dwarf) or [rogue planet](:Rogue_planet) of [spectral class](:Spectral_class) >Y2, located in constellation [Lyra](:Lyra) at approximately 47 [light-years](:Light-year) from [Earth](:Earth). It is the \"archetypal member\" of the Y spectral class."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
