<http://dbpedia.org/resource/858_El_Djezaïr> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "858 El Djezaïr /ɛlˌdʒɛzɑːˈɪər/ is a stony asteroid from the asteroid belt, about 24 kilometers in diameter. It was discovered on May 26, 1916 by French astronomer Frédéric Sy at the Algiers Observatory in Algeria, North Africa, and given the provisional designation 1916 a."@en .
