<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_2227> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NGC 2227 is a barred spiral galaxy with a morphological type of SB(rs)c located in the direction of the Canis Major constellation. It was discovered on January 27, 1835, by John Herschel. In 1986, a type Ia supernova with an apparent magnitude of 14.0 was detected within NGC 2227, and was designated SN 1986O."@en .
