<http://dbpedia.org/resource/WISE_1506+7027> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**WISEPC J150649.97+702736.0** (designation abbreviated to **WISE 1506+7027**, or **WISE J1506+7027**) is a [brown dwarf](:Brown_dwarf) star of [spectral class](:Spectral_class) T6, located in constellation [Ursa Minor](:Ursa_Minor). It is one of the [Sun's nearest neighbors](:List_of_nearest_stars), at a distance of 16.85 [light-years](:Light-year). Brown dwarfs closer to the Sun include [Luhman 16](:Luhman_16) and [WISE 0855−0714](:WISE_0855%E2%88%920714). Other brown dwarfs that may be closer to the Sun include [ε Indi Ba and ε Indi Bb](:Epsilon_Indi) at 11.8 light-years and [WISE 0350-5658](:WISE_0350-5658) at 12.1+5.2  −1.3 light-years."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
