<http://dbpedia.org/resource/MOA-2007-BLG-197Lb> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**MOA-2007-BLG-197Lb** is a [brown dwarf](:Brown_dwarf) discovered in August 2015 by the [MOA](:Microlensing_Observations_in_Astrophysics) collaboration. It is the first brown dwarf found by the microlensing method to orbit a solar-type star."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
