<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_4871> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NGC 4871 is a lenticular galaxy located about 310 million light-years away in the constellation of Coma Berenices. NGC 4871 was discovered by astronomer Heinrich d'Arrest on May 10, 1863. It is a member of the Coma Cluster."@en .
