<http://dbpedia.org/resource/AM_Herculis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "AM Herculis is a binary variable star located in the constellation Hercules. This star, along with the star AN Ursae Majoris, is the prototype for a category of cataclysmic variable stars called polars, or AM Her type stars."@en .
