<http://dbpedia.org/resource/HD_49947> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HD 49947 (HR 2531) is a solitary star in the southern circumpolar constellation Volans. It has an apparent magnitude of 6.36, placing it near the max naked eye visibility. Parallax measurements place the object at a distance of 459 light years but is receding with a heliocentric radial velocity of 15.88 km/s"@en .
