<http://dbpedia.org/resource/1239_Queteleta> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**1239 Queteleta** (), provisional designation 1932 CB, is a dark background [asteroid](:Asteroid) from the central regions of the [asteroid belt](:Asteroid_belt), approximately 17 kilometers in diameter. It was discovered on 4 February 1932, by Belgian astronomer [Eugène Delporte](:Eug%C3%A8ne_Delporte) at the [Royal Observatory of Belgium](:Royal_Observatory_of_Belgium) in Uccle. The asteroid was named after [Adolphe Quetelet](:Adolphe_Quetelet), a Belgian astronomer and mathematician."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
