<http://dbpedia.org/resource/WISE_1828+2650> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "WISE 1828+2650 (full designation WISEPA J182831.08+265037.8) is a possibly binary brown dwarf or rogue planet of spectral class >Y2, located in constellation Lyra at approximately 47 light-years from Earth. It is the \"archetypal member\" of the Y spectral class."@en .
