<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_3267> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NGC 3267 is a lenticular galaxy in the constellation Antlia. It is a member of the Antlia Cluster, which lies about 40.7 megaparsecs (132.7 million light-years) away. It was discovered on April 18, 1835 by the astronomer John Herschel."@en .
