<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_1052> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**NGC 1052** is an [elliptical](:Elliptical_galaxy) [galaxy](:Galaxy) in the [constellation](:Constellation) [Cetus](:Cetus_%28constellation%29). It was discovered on January 10, 1785 by the astronomer [William Herschel](:William_Herschel). It is a member of the eponymous NGC 1052 Group."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
