<http://dbpedia.org/resource/Max_Wolf> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**Maximilian Franz Joseph Cornelius Wolf** (21 June 1863 – 3 October 1932) was a German [astronomer](:Astronomer) and a pioneer in the field of [astrophotography](:Astrophotography). He was the chairman of astronomy at the [University of Heidelberg](:University_of_Heidelberg) and director of the [Heidelberg-Königstuhl State Observatory](:Heidelberg-K%C3%B6nigstuhl_State_Observatory) from 1902 until his death in 1932."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
