<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_3267> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**NGC 3267** is a [lenticular galaxy](:Lenticular_galaxy) in the [constellation](:Constellation) [Antlia](:Antlia). It is a member of the [Antlia Cluster](:Antlia_Cluster), which lies about 40.7 [megaparsecs](:Parsec%23Megaparsecs_and_gigaparsecs) (132.7 million [light-years](:Light-year%29) away. It was discovered on April 18, 1835 by the astronomer [John Herschel](:John_Herschel)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
