<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_4871> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**NGC 4871** is a [lenticular galaxy](:Lenticular_galaxy) located about 310 million [light-years](:Light-year) away in the [constellation](:Constellation) of [Coma Berenices](:Coma_Berenices_%28constellation%29). NGC 4871 was discovered by astronomer [Heinrich d'Arrest](:Heinrich_d%27Arrest) on May 10, 1863. It is a member of the [Coma Cluster](:Coma_Cluster)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
