<http://dbpedia.org/resource/AM_Herculis> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**AM Herculis** is a [binary](:Binary_star) [variable star](:Variable_star) located in the [constellation](:Constellation) [Hercules](:Hercules_%28constellation%29). This star, along with the star *[AN Ursae Majoris](:AN_Ursae_Majoris)*, is the prototype for a category of [cataclysmic variable](:Cataclysmic_variable) stars called *[polars](:Polar_%28cataclysmic_variable%29)*, or *AM Her* type stars."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
