<http://dbpedia.org/resource/CoRoT-22b> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "CoRoT-22b is a transiting exoplanet found by the CoRoT space telescope in 2011 and confirmed in 2014. It is a hot and small (smaller than Uranus) gas giant planet orbiting a G0IV star with Te = 5939K, M = 1.099M☉, R = 1.136R☉, and above-solar metallicity. It has an estimated age of between 1.3 and 5.3 Gyr."@en .
