<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_7077> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> " **NGC 7077** is a [lenticular](:Lenticular_galaxy) [blue compact dwarf galaxy](:Blue_compact_dwarf_galaxy) located about 56 million [light-years](:Light-year) away from Earth in the constellation [Aquarius](:Aquarius_%28constellation%29). Discovered by astronomer [Albert Marth](:Albert_Marth) on August 11, 1863, the galaxy lies within the [Local Void](:Local_Void)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
