<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_2227> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**NGC 2227** is a [barred spiral](:Barred_spiral_galaxy) [galaxy](:Galaxy) with a morphological type of SB(rs)c located in the direction of the [Canis Major](:Canis_Major) [constellation](:Constellation). It was discovered on January 27, 1835, by [John Herschel](:John_Herschel).In 1986, a [type Ia supernova](:Type_Ia_supernova) with an [apparent magnitude](:Apparent_magnitude) of 14.0 was detected within NGC 2227, and was designated **SN 1986O**."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
