<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_822> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**NGC 822** is an [elliptical galaxy](:Elliptical_galaxy) in the [constellation](:Constellation) [Phoenix](:Phoenix_%28constellation%29). It is estimated to be about 233 million [light-years](:Light-year) from the [Milky Way](:Milky_Way) and has a [diameter](:Diameter) of approximately 80,000 light-years. NGC 822 was discovered on September 5, 1834, by [astronomer](:Astronomer) [John Herschel](:John_Herschel)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
