<http://dbpedia.org/resource/NGC_4654> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "**NGC 4654** is an [intermediate spiral galaxy](:Intermediate_spiral_galaxy) in the [constellation](:Constellation) of [Virgo](:Virgo_%28constellation%29) at a distance of 55 million [light years](:Light-year) (16.8 [mega](:Mega-)[parsecs](:Parsec%29) from the [Milky Way](:Milky_Way) that can be spotted with [amateur](:Amateur_astronomy) [telescopes](:Telescope)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
